<h2>About</h2>

<p>
Every person's path to recovery is different. That is why Hearts Turn Healing
& Recovery pairs evidence-based clinical care with a whole-person approach,
integrating each client's community, and their personal or spiritual beliefs,
into their treatment.
</p>
