<section>
<h2>What We Offer</h2>

<p>
Our Intensive Outpatient Program (IOP) combines group therapy, individual
therapy, psychiatric services, and case management, all grounded in the belief
that substance use is often a response to deeper struggles, not the struggle
itself.
</p>

